gitzipinline <p>Fetch the bundle directly from a pinned tree in a GitHub repository. <code>path</code> selects the file within <code>repo@ref</code>.</p> <pre><code>"distribution": {
  "kind": "git",
  "repository": "https://github.com/Vineyard-Intelligence/cidr-expand",
  "ref": "4d2f8b19c0a7e6f3b1d5a4c9e8f70123456789ab",
  "path": "manifest.json",
  "integrity": { "algo": "sha256", "hash": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb924..." }
}
</code></pre> <p>Fetch a prebuilt archive (typically a GitHub release asset) named by <code>archive.url</code>, with an optional <code>archive.sha256</code>.</p> <pre><code>"distribution": {
  "kind": "zip",
  "repository": "https://github.com/Vineyard-Intelligence/chaos-pack",
  "ref": "v1.2.0",
  "archive": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Vineyard-Intelligence/chaos-pack/releases/download/v1.2.0/chaos-pack.zip",
    "sha256": "9b74c9897bac770ffc029102a200c5de..."
  }
}
</code></pre> <p>The bundle ships inline in the manifest itself — used by the six reference plugins (Korean Roulette, Russian Roulette, Thanos Snap, Black Hole, Dumb AI Optimizer, Schrödinger's Node) and other tiny, fully self-contained plugins. No external fetch is required.</p> <pre><code>"distribution": {
  "kind": "inline",
  "integrity": { "algo": "sha256", "hash": "..." }
}
</code></pre>

gitzipinline <p>GitHub 저장소의 고정된 트리에서 직접 번들을 가져옵니다. <code>path</code>는 <code>repo@ref</code> 내의 파일을 선택합니다.</p> <pre><code>"distribution": {
  "kind": "git",
  "repository": "https://github.com/Vineyard-Intelligence/cidr-expand",
  "ref": "4d2f8b19c0a7e6f3b1d5a4c9e8f70123456789ab",
  "path": "manifest.json",
  "integrity": { "algo": "sha256", "hash": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb924..." }
}
</code></pre> <p><code>archive.url</code>로 지정된 미리 빌드된 아카이브(일반적으로 GitHub 릴리스 자산)를 가져옵니다. 선택적으로 <code>archive.sha256</code>을 사용합니다.</p> <pre><code>"distribution": {
  "kind": "zip",
  "repository": "https://github.com/Vineyard-Intelligence/chaos-pack",
  "ref": "v1.2.0",
  "archive": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Vineyard-Intelligence/chaos-pack/releases/download/v1.2.0/chaos-pack.zip",
    "sha256": "9b74c9897bac770ffc029102a200c5de..."
  }
}
</code></pre> <p>번들이 매니페스트 자체에 인라인으로 제공됩니다 — 6개의 참조 플러그인(Korean Roulette, Russian Roulette, Thanos Snap, Black Hole, Dumb AI Optimizer, Schrödinger's Node) 및 기타 작고 완전히 자체 포함된 플러그인에서 사용됩니다. 외부 가져오기가 필요하지 않습니다.</p> <pre><code>"distribution": {
  "kind": "inline",
  "integrity": { "algo": "sha256", "hash": "..." }
}
</code></pre>
